### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Gaming Match
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/match/gaming
content-type: application/json

{
  "requesterId": "req-1",
  "region": "us-east-1",
  "maxLatencyMs": 80
}

### Compute Match
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/match/compute
content-type: application/json

{
  "requesterId": "req-2",
  "region": "us-east-1",
  "minCpuCores": 8,
  "minRamGb": 16,
  "requireGpu": true,
  "minGpuVramGb": 8
}

### Submit Compute Job
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/jobs
content-type: application/json

{
  "requesterId": "req-3",
  "imageRef": "ghcr.io/acme/render:latest",
  "command": ["blender", "-b", "scene.blend", "-f", "1"],
  "region": "us-east-1",
  "minCpuCores": 8,
  "minRamGb": 16,
  "requireGpu": true,
  "minGpuVramGb": 8,
  "timeoutSec": 3600
}
